        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Sunflower Stronghold!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm is being over run with pests and it is your duty to defend your farm, your lively-hood, with all your can muster! They never said it would be easy, but here you are! Use budgeting and strategy to come out on top!<br><br>Grow Crops, Process Resources and Construct Towers and Survive! <br><br>I made this game as a prototype last year and will continue to develop the Sunflower Stronghold series in Unity. Please include any feedback you have, criticism is encouraged! <br><br>Let me know if you were able to make it past Day 100 &amp; have FUN! <br><br>Enjoy!</p>",
